        ecrm:P2_has_type    <http://data.silknow.org/observation/technical-observation> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note    "Lid and sides covered in silk velvet; base covered in blue linen. Silk fringe in blocks of blue, red and yellow, on a heading in chevron design in silver thread. Lined with plain cream linen. There is a painted vellum panel set into the lid, with border of flowers but blank centre; edge in pink and silver braid."@en ;
        crmsci:O8_observed  <http://data.silknow.org/object/55acb455-63cf-382e-b19a-f51760984f7c> .

